<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ho 1st-half net profit down six pct.</title>
<headline>Kian Ho 1st-half net profit down six pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    2.36  vs  2.50</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	 1.81  vs  2.50</p>
<p>    Turnover		     35.11  vs 33.95</p>
<p>    Interest expense	    0.59  vs  0.76</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 3.26  vs  3.57</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.93  vs  1.11</p>
<p>    Minorities		    0.02  vs  0.05</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Kian Ho Bearings Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
